==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[bók]]'' meaning "[[book]]" + ''[[stafur]]'' meaning "[[letter]] of the alphabet".

===Noun===
'''bókstafur''' {{m}}

# [[letter]] (of the [[alphabet]])

====Synonyms====
* (''letter''): [[stafur]] {{m}}

====Derived terms====
* [[bókstaflegur]] {{m}}, [[bókstafleg]] {{f}}, [[bókstaflegt]] {{n}}
* [[bókstafstrú]]

